<div class="page-header"><div><span class="staff-eyebrow">Digital Business Card</span><h2><?=htmlspecialchars($record['display_name'])?></h2><p>Contact details are derived from Staff Management. Only presentation and visibility live here.</p></div><div class="staff-header-actions"><a class="btn" target="_blank" href="<?=htmlspecialchars($cardUrl)?>">Preview Card</a><a class="btn" href="<?=htmlspecialchars(url('/admin/digital-business-cards'))?>">Back</a></div></div>
<div class="staff-profile-layout"><main><form method="post" action="<?=htmlspecialchars(url('/admin/digital-business-cards/'.$record['id'].'/update'))?>"><?=csrf_field()?><section class="card staff-form-section"><div class="staff-section-title"><i data-lucide="sliders-horizontal"></i><div><h3>Card settings</h3><p>Changing the public slug automatically refreshes QR metadata.</p></div></div><div class="staff-form-grid"><div class="form-group span-2"><label>Public Card URL</label><div class="slug-input"><span><?=htmlspecialchars(rtrim(dirname($cardUrl),'/').'/')?></span><input class="form-control" name="public_slug" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($record['public_slug'])?>"></div></div><div class="form-group"><label>Theme</label><select class="form-control" name="theme"><option value="udyam-premium" <?=$record['theme']==='udyam-premium'?'selected':''?>>Udyam Premium</option><option value="udyam-midnight" <?=$record['theme']==='udyam-midnight'?'selected':''?>>Udyam Midnight</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label>Card Status</label><select class="form-control" name="status"><option value="enabled" <?=$record['card_status']==='enabled'?'selected':''?>>Enabled</option><option value="disabled" <?=$record['card_status']==='disabled'?'selected':''?>>Disabled</option></select></div></div><div class="card-visibility-grid"><?php foreach(['show_mobile'=>'Mobile','show_whatsapp'=>'WhatsApp','show_email'=>'Email','show_address'=>'Address','show_linkedin'=>'LinkedIn','show_bio'=>'Bio'] as $key=>$label):?><label><input type="checkbox" name="<?=$key?>" value="1" <?=$record[$key]?'checked':''?>><span><i data-lucide="check"></i></span><?=$label?></label><?php endforeach?></div><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save Card Settings</button></section></form>
<section class="card staff-detail-card"><div class="staff-section-title"><i data-lucide="chart-no-axes-combined"></i><div><h3>Engagement analytics</h3><p>Privacy-conscious aggregate interaction totals.</p></div></div><div class="staff-analytics-grid large"><?php foreach(['total_views'=>'Total Views','unique_views'=>'Unique Views','qr_scans'=>'QR Scans','save_contact'=>'Save Contact','whatsapp'=>'WhatsApp','call'=>'Calls','email'=>'Emails','website'=>'Website','share'=>'Shares','wallet'=>'Wallet'] as $key=>$label):?><div><strong><?=number_format((int)($record[$key]??$analytics[$key]??0))?></strong><span><?=$label?></span></div><?php endforeach?></div><p class="staff-muted">Last viewed: <?= $record['last_viewed_at']?htmlspecialchars(date('d M Y, g:i A',strtotime($record['last_viewed_at']))):'Never'?></p></section></main>
<aside><section class="card staff-card-panel"><img class="staff-qr-preview" src="<?=htmlspecialchars(url('/admin/digital-business-cards/'.$record['id'].'/qr?format=svg'))?>" alt="QR code"><h3>Print-ready QR</h3><p>Points to the current public card URL and remains stable unless the URL changes.</p><div class="staff-card-panel-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="<?=htmlspecialchars(url('/admin/digital-business-cards/'.$record['id'].'/qr?download=1'))?>">Download PNG</a><a class="btn" href="<?=htmlspecialchars(url('/admin/digital-business-cards/'.$record['id'].'/qr?format=svg&download=1'))?>">Download SVG</a><a class="btn" href="<?=htmlspecialchars(url('/admin/digital-business-cards/'.$record['id'].'/vcard'))?>">Download vCard</a><button class="btn" type="button" data-copy="<?=htmlspecialchars($cardUrl,ENT_QUOTES)?>">Copy Card Link</button></div><form method="post" action="<?=htmlspecialchars(url('/admin/digital-business-cards/'.$record['id'].'/regenerate'))?>" onsubmit="return confirm('Regenerate QR metadata? The public URL will stay unchanged.')"><?=csrf_field()?><button class="btn btn-ghost" type="submit">Regenerate QR</button></form></section></aside></div>
<script>document.querySelector('[data-copy]')?.addEventListener('click',async e=>{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(e.currentTarget.dataset.copy);e.currentTarget.textContent='Copied'});</script>
